  "title": "AEGIS: Wearable Drone Detection & Tracking",
  "description": "A head-mountable drone detection and tracking prototype built around a Raspberry Pi 5. A camera and computer vision find and follow nearby drones, an IMU compensates for head movement, and a motorized pan/tilt gimbal keeps the target in view. Built as modular ROS 2 packages, currently in active development.",
